            "authorAssociation": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Sorry, but I don't think there is a reasonable way to support that. The best compromise for this is the suggested `MiniFiles.open(vim.api.nvim_buf_get_name(0))` approach but with `@` mapping to reveal the current working directory.",
            "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">Sorry, but I don't think there is a reasonable way to support that. The best compromise for this is the suggested <code class=\"notranslate\">MiniFiles.open(vim.api.nvim_buf_get_name(0))</code> approach but with <code class=\"notranslate\">@</code> mapping to reveal the current working directory.</p>",
            "bodyText": "Sorry, but I don't think there is a reasonable way to support that. The best compromise for this is the suggested MiniFiles.open(vim.api.nvim_buf_get_name(0)) approach but with @ mapping to reveal the current working directory.",
